<title>UK: CANADIAN AIR JULY CARGO UP 7.3 PCT.</title>
<headline>CANADIAN AIR JULY CARGO UP 7.3 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian Air Cargo said its July cargo tonne miles (CTMs) totalled 48.3 million, an increase of 7.3 percent from July 1996</p>
<p>    Month    1997	 1996	 Percent</p>
<p>    July     million CTMs  million CTMs    Change</p>
<p>    Freight  46.9	43.7	 up  7.3</p>
<p>    Airmail   1.4	 1.3	 up  7.7</p>
<p>    Total    48.3	45.0	 up  7.3</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel+ 44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017 - www.racs.com</p>
</text>
